# Phantom Train (4/4 Vehicle, trample): "Sacrifice another artifact or creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on this Vehicle. It becomes a Spirit artifact
# creature in addition to its other types until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices a Memnite: one counter, so the Train is a 5/5 Spirit artifact
# creature. It attacks into Bot2's Memnite: 1 damage is lethal to the blocker and the other 4 trample through (20 -> 16).

